{"availability":"available","full":"phalladar/MacDirStat","name":"MacDirStat","description":"Free, open-source disk space analyzer for macOS, inspired by WinDirStat. See what's taking up space on your Mac with an interactive treemap and track down large files. Native SwiftUI app for Apple silicon and Intel, signed and notarized, fully offline.","category":"Other","language":"Swift","stars":67,"forks":10,"created":"2026-02-16T16:54:17Z","updated":"2026-10-03T16:08:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://github.com/phalladar/MacDirStat/releases/latest","topics":["apple-silicon","daisydisk-alternative","disk-analyzer","disk-cleanup","disk-space","disk-space-analyzer","disk-usage","disk-usage-analyzer","mac","macos","macos-app","storage-analyzer","swift","swiftui","treemap","treemap-visualization","utility","windirstat","windirstat-alternative","wiztree-alternative"],"demo":null,"color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z","stars":67,"forks":10}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( [](#what-version-of-macos-does-macdirstat-require) [](LICENSE)","MacDirStat is a free, open-source disk space analyzer for macOS. It scans your Mac and draws every file as a color-coded treemap, so you can see what's taking up space and free up storage.","It's a native Mac app inspired by WinDirStat on Windows, with no ads, subscriptions, accounts, or tracking."],"features":["Interactive treemap. Every file is drawn as a rectangle sized by its disk usage, nested inside its folders, using the squarified treemap layout. Large files and folders stand out at a glance, and bigger rectangles are…","Color-coded file types. Files are colored by category: documents, images, video, audio, code, archives, applications, system, caches, and other.","Folder tree sidebar. Browse the folder hierarchy, sorted largest first, with each folder's size.","Inspector panel. Shows size, allocated size, file and folder counts, last-modified date, and a bar chart of what each folder contains by file type.","Drill down. Double-click a rectangle to focus the treemap on its folder, then go back up with the breadcrumb bar or the Back button."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/phalladar/MacDirStat/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"71dd6f569a98326b31e500b2316c29a0b7865f078f419151b15929a13f1a9587","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( [](#what-version-of-macos-does-macdirstat-require) [](LICENSE)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/phalladar/MacDirStat/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"To be notified of new versions, click Watch → Custom → Releases at the top of this page (requires a GitHub account).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/phalladar/MacDirStat/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"71dd6f569a98326b31e500b2316c29a0b7865f078f419151b15929a13f1a9587","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/phalladar/MacDirStat/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T16:08:37Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/phalladar/MacDirStat/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z","hash":"71dd6f569a98326b31e500b2316c29a0b7865f078f419151b15929a13f1a9587","originalBytes":14909,"storedBytes":14909,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["macdirstat","file","disk","macos","files","size","folder","space","click","mac","app","full","treemap","folders","see","access","free","open","scan","what","applications","system","allocated","apple","choose","other","shows","swift","usage","analyzer","any","code","doesn","drives","each","folder.","how","license","rectangle","